From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] spi-tmi8152: drop the internal status export

modpost rejects exporting a local symbol.  tmi8152_spi_status() is
declared static in the shared header and is only used inside
tmi8152_spi_dev.c, so remove the EXPORT_SYMBOL; the two SPI read/write
helpers remain exported for the motor module.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/tmi8152_spi_dev.c
+++ b/tmi8152_spi_dev.c
@@ -210,7 +210,6 @@
 
     return ret;
 }
-EXPORT_SYMBOL(tmi8152_spi_status);
 
 int tmi8152_spi_read(int addr, int *value)
 {
